{"id":"promise-see-castle-gates","promise":"char-neighbor will go to the castle gates to look for the actress; this leaves an open next-beat about what he might see there.","scene":"s-003","quote":"By the time he left, the neighbour had done what he always did with a thing he could not rest: he buttoned his overcoat and stepped out into the street with the intention of walking toward the castle gates.","dueByScene":"null","paidOffBy":null}
